{"logId": "818d5d39-05f8-45fc-a736-fc679d2c2af2", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [165, 141, 456, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [456.0, 141.0], [456.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：懂得健康的原理，身体与情绪相互之间的影响作用，避免造成严重的痛苦或不可挽回的身心伤害。", "block_bbox": [164, 215, 1002, 271], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 215.0], [1002.0, 215.0], [1002.0, 271.0], [164.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：健康是生命中一切美好的基础和前提，做任何事情都不能以牺牲健康为代价，如果失去健康，无论身体、还是精神方面，都会给人造成极大的痛苦、无奈、甚至绝望。要懂得健康的原理，在懂得精神与身体之间相互作用的基础上，不让自己长期沉浸在精神痛苦中，也不过度透支身体、对身体造成不可挽回的后果。", "block_bbox": [163, 295, 1013, 412], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 295.0], [1013.0, 295.0], [1013.0, 412.0], [163.0, 412.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [165, 453, 283, 476], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 453.0], [282.0, 453.0], [282.0, 475.0], [165.0, 475.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、认知到健康的重要性", "block_bbox": [182, 493, 380, 515], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 493.0], [379.0, 493.0], [379.0, 514.0], [182.0, 514.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、懂得健康的原理，理解身体与情绪之间的相互影响作用，保证基本的精神健康和身体健康指标", "block_bbox": [180, 524, 951, 547], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 524.0], [951.0, 524.0], [951.0, 547.0], [180.0, 547.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、每年一次体检，根据体检结果和医生建议定期复查", "block_bbox": [182, 554, 611, 577], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 554.0], [611.0, 554.0], [611.0, 577.0], [182.0, 577.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、体重指数BMI在18~27.9范围内，个合格的在现有基础上保持或优化指标，不能偏离更多", "block_bbox": [181, 585, 903, 608], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 601.0], [902.0, 607.0], [902.0, 585.0], [886.0, 585.0], [849.0, 585.0], [537.0, 585.0], [512.0, 585.0], [500.0, 585.0], [494.0, 593.0], [187.0, 585.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、任何情况下超过36小时，要主动睡觉休息，不透支身体", "block_bbox": [181, 615, 651, 638], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 615.0], [651.0, 615.0], [651.0, 638.0], [181.0, 638.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、有强烈的自我健康防护意识，注意个人及环境卫生、特殊情况及时接种疫苗等", "block_bbox": [181, 647, 827, 670], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 647.0], [827.0, 647.0], [827.0, 670.0], [181.0, 670.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[96]", "block_bbox": [573, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 492, 932], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [492.0, 900.0], [492.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、为自己及家人合理地购买医疗险、大病险", "block_bbox": [220, 975, 579, 999], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 975.0], [579.0, 975.0], [579.0, 999.0], [220.0, 999.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、如果自己或家人有慢性病，了解相关知识、掌握常见问题和紧急状况的处理方法", "block_bbox": [221, 1006, 882, 1030], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1006.0], [882.0, 1006.0], [882.0, 1030.0], [221.0, 1030.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、不疑病、瞒病、恐病，及时就诊", "block_bbox": [221, 1037, 509, 1060], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1037.0], [509.0, 1037.0], [509.0, 1060.0], [221.0, 1060.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、不私用偏方、迷信、求神拜佛等行为", "block_bbox": [221, 1068, 553, 1091], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1068.0], [553.0, 1068.0], [553.0, 1091.0], [221.0, 1091.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、不刻意隐瞒自身传染性疾病，及时上报", "block_bbox": [221, 1099, 572, 1122], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1099.0], [572.0, 1099.0], [572.0, 1122.0], [221.0, 1122.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "12、不因不良的生活习惯，造成自我健康伤害和家庭矛盾（如酗酒等）", "block_bbox": [221, 1129, 774, 1153], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1129.0], [774.0, 1129.0], [774.0, 1153.0], [221.0, 1153.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1192, 337, 1215], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1192.0], [336.0, 1192.0], [336.0, 1214.0], [202.0, 1214.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、长期沉浸于自我谴责、自我抨击或愧疚、罪恶感中", "block_bbox": [218, 1232, 648, 1255], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1232.0], [648.0, 1232.0], [648.0, 1255.0], [218.0, 1255.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、精神焦虑和抑郁且心灵闭塞、不主动排解和寻求方法", "block_bbox": [218, 1261, 668, 1284], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1261.0], [668.0, 1261.0], [668.0, 1284.0], [218.0, 1284.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、与人发生争执和矛盾时，不能掌控情绪极点，对他人健康造成伤害", "block_bbox": [219, 1290, 772, 1314], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1290.0], [772.0, 1290.0], [772.0, 1314.0], [219.0, 1314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、给他人制造精神压力和精神包袱，带来紧迫感", "block_bbox": [218, 1320, 613, 1343], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1320.0], [613.0, 1320.0], [613.0, 1343.0], [218.0, 1343.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、嘲笑、贬低、诋毁等损害他人人格的行为", "block_bbox": [219, 1350, 576, 1372], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1350.0], [576.0, 1350.0], [576.0, 1372.0], [219.0, 1372.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、通过语言暴力进行人身攻击或把人身攻击视为调侃", "block_bbox": [219, 1379, 648, 1402], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1379.0], [648.0, 1379.0], [648.0, 1402.0], [219.0, 1402.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、当面欣赏和认可，背后怨恨、嫉妒，不真诚", "block_bbox": [219, 1409, 596, 1432], "block_id": 25, "block_order": 26, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1409.0], [596.0, 1409.0], [596.0, 1432.0], [219.0, 1432.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[97]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 649, 1497], "block_id": 26, "block_order": null, "group_id": 26, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8030441403388977, "coordinate": [165, 141, 456, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [456.0, 141.0], [456.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6313793659210205, "coordinate": [164, 215, 1002, 271], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[164.0, 215.0], [1002.0, 215.0], [1002.0, 271.0], [164.0, 271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, 